==Battleground==
*50 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*50 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*50 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Being the very first stage in [[Stories of Legend]], it contains very weak enemies and is easily beaten by using [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

As it has a very low [[Cat Energy|energy]] cost and can be completed quickly, it is recommended for farming [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and for Weekly [[Catnip Challenges]] that require completing any SoL stage multiple times. This applies even after [[Torture Room]] becomes avaliable, since [[The Legend Begins]] is the best source of Sprockets in SoL.

==Trivia==
*As the first [[Legend Stages|Legend Stage]], Earthshaker's name may refer to how [[Stories of Legend]] was an "earth-shaking" addition to the game with its many new stages, enemies and [[Backgrounds|backgrounds]].

